[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6717640332","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166#issuecomment-6717640332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166","id":6717640332,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkGcOjA","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-08T05:17:04Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T05:17:04Z","body":"The two cross-source duplicate pairs now use one canonical proposal each: `CS-PROP-NBRC1321_CO2_BICARBONATE_STOCK` and `CS-PROP-NBRC1321_SULFIDE_STOCK`. The redundant named-lane definitions are retired from active proposals while their original artifacts remain preserved. Both source cases, every occurrence and raw label remain bound to the canonical owner.\n\nBicarbonate preserves 8.4 g NaHCO3 plus 100 mL distilled water and explicit CO2 saturation in both sources. Sulfide preserves the distinct batch scales: NBRC 1257 uses 12 g Na2S·9H2O plus 50 mL water, whereas NBRC 1321 uses 24 g plus 100 mL. The shared precursor-to-added-water ratio and handling support formulation equivalence; neither source establishes a measured final volume. Generic raw labels remain non-resolving. The separate neutralized and 5% sulfide preparations and generic 84 g/L bicarbonate candidate are not merged.\n\n[Canonical comparison](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/blob/1894d28d94df4e654ebce9752c23a2321aeb21c5/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-01/shard/concentration_stocks/captures/crosslane-consolidation-final-v3.json) binds the original consolidation. The sulfide successor in [the atmosphere remediation](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/blob/1894d28d94df4e654ebce9752c23a2321aeb21c5/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-01/shard/named_stocks/atmosphere1167/remediation.json) removes N2 from material parts while retaining storage conditions. Same-source phenanthrene and Metal44 duplicates remain tracked under [#1159](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1159); Metal44 is an auxiliary component of the Hutner parent. The [final independent scientific review](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/blob/1894d28d94df4e654ebce9752c23a2321aeb21c5/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-01/shard/independent_review/final-188-scientific-review-v1.json) confirms final active-ledger uniqueness and unioned backlinks; the [native full-catalog regression](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/blob/1894d28d94df4e654ebce9752c23a2321aeb21c5/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-01/shard/validation/full-catalog-partonomy-corrected-v3.json) validates the complete combined overlay with zero violations.\n\nNo maintained-owner merge or release approval is asserted.\n\n<!-- mim-review-round: all-unmatched-20261107-worker01-continuation; mim-fingerprints: w01-continuation-mediaingredientmech-1166 -->\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/